---- MODULE space_equal__two_actions__plain ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == x = 0 /\ y = 0
Next == (x' = x /\ y' = y) \/ (UNCHANGED vars)

====

